{"attachments":[{"id":"att-1792210765394-7fb441584dd2d4d6","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792210765394-7fb441584dd2d4d6-259668.webp","sha256":"b6138298423163397980b3a0b591d81bd37ae43c1718a1a4144752d4088a27a9"},{"id":"att-1792307574560-14ce67f0c12df80","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792307574560-14ce67f0c12df80-259681.webp","sha256":"15413f367b368484c6484817e5c2002fce057fe635964dbd7f977dffacee16a1"},{"id":"att-1792307637066-3256aa30f8179f7c","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792307637066-3256aa30f8179f7c-259677.webp","sha256":"b708f2cf943699893d605f72be63ceb57b76691b4caedc9feddb05218ea469eb"},{"id":"att-1792307677539-d4a2c3d5ecc98801","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792307677539-d4a2c3d5ecc98801-259678.webp","sha256":"c579a3e8c939f3fc1390bd98fef6120cd2b2cedfc377e93a7d9ec27d31c3cbc0"},{"id":"att-1792307688537-c6fcff218186df6a","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792307688537-c6fcff218186df6a-259676.webp","sha256":"c13b5d4294d8ffe4ff0102712cd997066a362b4489010ecfa61690824b759732"},{"id":"att-1792307828344-e59edd5a93244268","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792307828344-e59edd5a93244268-259687.webp","sha256":"4079adcd068ee100039f013793d5ad635fd86f5eba2187f1e51b5273577f4c1d"},{"id":"att-1792307867822-2a462fd1cca4181f","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792307867822-2a462fd1cca4181f-259709.webp","sha256":"9f2a000e99ccc56c027c76fda0e6607d05de0cef9c2d1520ffbc8faf805c6554"},{"id":"att-1792308171425-97fd0ec882ef870f","mimeType":"image/webp","path":"assets/att-1792308171425-97fd0ec882ef870f-259711.webp","sha256":"1bd9a4d0035b428dbf782a80a9430476c8f9a601e33e4e653e5db9fc040c0868"}],"body":"![정부청사역에 내려 셔틀 탔다](layall-attachment:att-1792210765394-7fb441584dd2d4d6)\n셔틀에서 담배냄새남 ㅠ \n너무 막혀서 도착까지 거의 한 시간 걸렸다. \n\nㅋㅋ빵축제 도착했는데 사람이 너무 많아서 그냥 포기..\n신세계 백화점갔다.\n\n ![귀여운 스티치♥♡](layall-attachment:att-1792307574560-14ce67f0c12df80)\n\n매드포갈릭 가려다가 메뉴판이 너무 어려워서 포기하고 신차이 갔다. \n[신차이 대전신세계점](https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%8B%A0%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4%20%EB%8C%80%EC%A0%84%EC%8B%A0%EC%84%B8%EA%B3%84%EC%A0%90/place/1592867394?c=15.00,0,0,0,dh&lat=36.374780&lng=127.382350)\n![삼선짬뽕. 맛있는데 국물맛이 약간 너구리랑 신라면 섞은 맛](layall-attachment:att-1792307637066-3256aa30f8179f7c)\n![신차이 짜장, 고추 제거. 떼깔곱고 맛있었음.](layall-attachment:att-1792307677539-d4a2c3d5ecc98801)\n![흑마늘 탕수육. 얘가 제일 맛있었다.](layall-attachment:att-1792307688537-c6fcff218186df6a)\n\n![다시 빵축제 가서 슬로브레드 빵만 샀다. 베이컨돌돌이 빼고 솔직히 그닥이었음ㅠ](layall-attachment:att-1792307828344-e59edd5a93244268)\n\n메가박스에서 오디세이봤는데 개무섭 ㅠ. 막판에 백영승 펑펑 울었다는데 못봐서 아쉬웠다. 역시 f는 신기해.\n\n![숙소에서 f1보며 회 잔뜩 시켰는데 진짜 맛있었음.](layall-attachment:att-1792307867822-2a462fd1cca4181f)\n\n[깻잎막회 대전봉명점](https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EA%B9%BB%EC%9E%8E%EB%A7%89%ED%9A%8C%20%EB%8C%80%EC%A0%84%EB%B4%89%EB%AA%85%EC%A0%90/place/2043077243?c=15.00,0,0,0,dh&lat=36.357584&lng=127.344191)\n막회담당. 깻잎이랑 막회, 초장이 너무 잘 어울림 ㅠㅜ \n\n[나나히카리](https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%82%98%EB%82%98%ED%9E%88%EC%B9%B4%EB%A6%AC/place/1047957052?c=15.00,0,0,0,dh&lat=36.361959&lng=127.354580)\n방어 담당. 사각사각하고 달고 최고였음.\n\n둘 다 겨울에 한번 더 먹을 예정.\n\n![다음날 점심으로 먹은 소고기. 무난 평범 맛있었다.](layall-attachment:att-1792308171425-97fd0ec882ef870f)\n\n \n","folderId":"folder-daa5aebdfed41679","format":"layall-note","highlights":[],"noteId":"note-54753a2e-7490-4b22-bf58-abcc506e2758","pageId":"page-cd64e30e-21ad-46ac-ab24-e0c84ae74c44","permalink":"2026-10-17-5a3d8f13","postId":"post-5a3d8f133b1ed96b749ff0d4b83542c1","publishOptions":{"folderId":"folder-daa5aebdfed41679","includeAttachments":true,"includeHighlights":true,"includeSummaries":true,"includeTags":true,"includeTasks":false},"revision":1,"sourceUpdatedAt":1792308192017,"summaries":[],"tags":[],"tasks":[],"title":"[대전] 2026년 10월 17일 빵축제가 목적이었던 데이트","version":1}